      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question"
          >Is this a critique of time zones or daylight saving time?</button
        >
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            No. Umi‑Time is not a criticism of civil‑time systems. It is an
            alternative that avoids political offsets and seasonal rules by
            grounding itself in the UTC day.
